#: admin/views/view-cache.php:84
msgid "Query parameters that do not change the page. A URL whose parameters are ALL on this list is served the same cached page as the plain URL; the address in the browser is left as it is, so tracking pixels still read it. Prefilled with the tracking parameters social networks, ad platforms and campaign links append (fbclid, igsh, gclid, ttclid, utm_* and others). A trailing * matches every name with that beginning. Remove a name if a plugin on your site reads that parameter on the server. Do not add a parameter that changes what the page shows - a URL with a parameter that is not listed is never served from cache. One per line."
